        "description": "Whether a local seat activates automatically at boot (Eager) or waits for a claim (OnDemand) \u2014 the per-seat authored policy SeatActivation declares. Both doors converge on the identical Server.WorldPopulation.ActivateSeat call through the same SessionRequest.Join/WorldServer.ApplySession session-join seam regardless of which policy admitted the seat \u2014 a seat activated on demand (player.join, or a controller\u0027s own hot-plug first touch via Client.PlayerRoster.ResolveDeviceSlot) is indistinguishable from one activated at boot the instant it is active.",
